      "writtenOn": "2026-10-30T18:24:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we reject non-positive `session-cleanup-max-time` values during startup? `%f` accepts both `0` and negative values, but `cnat_session_scan()` checks the elapsed time before processing its first bucket. With either value it returns at the same bucket on every wakeup, so expired sessions are never reclaimed; continued traffic can exhaust the session limit and prevent new flows. Please require a positive budget and cover invalid values in a configuration test.",
